GoGuacamole
Copyright (c) 2026 Nilton Oliveira (jniltinho). Licensed under the MIT License.

This product talks to Apache Guacamole guacd (https://guacamole.apache.org/),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0, and bundles guacamole-common-js
(Apache License 2.0) in its web frontend.

The Go Guacamole protocol implementation (internal/guac) was informed by
github.com/wwt/guac (Apache License 2.0, Copyright World Wide Technology).
No source files were copied verbatim.

The 14 legacy visual themes were ported from the in-house Guacamole theme
extension (Bionexo themes).
